188-**Scope.** This check verifies the owner's ruling against its own grounds, re-derives the gate for the tool the ruling selects, repairs the three round-6 findings, and — in section 13 — checks a claim this document makes about itself. It does **not** implement the recommendation: no workflow file, no template scaffold, no repository seam, and no GitHub Actions job. The only inputs created are three throwaway fixture directories under `$TMPDIR`, deleted when the script exits, plus two cached downloads outside the run directory: the pinned TruffleHog release artefacts and a clone of `trufflesecurity/test_keys`. Nothing under `.github/` is written.
